則懼有私，宣之則恐非宜，進退不安。策聞之，歡笑曰：\"昔管仲相齊，一則仲父，二則仲父，而桓公爲霸者宗。今子布賢，我能用之，其功名獨不在我乎!\"，","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line012:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"張昭","kind":"person","person_id":"roi_rz4_ute","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line012:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"子布","kind":"person","person_id":"roi_rz4_ute","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line012:m0020","start":20,"end":24,"surface":"白侯子安","kind":"person","person_id":"dsp_hdz_2xc","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line012:m0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"趙昱","kind":"person","person_id":"5fj_15m_2bb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line012:m0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"王朗","kind":"person","person_id":"d21_081_910","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line012:m0063","start":63,"end":64,"surface":"朗","kind":"person","person_id":"d21_081_910","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line012:m0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"陳琳","kind":"person","person_id":"cca_b07_1cb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line012:m0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"陶謙","kind":"person","person_id":"0c6_0ce_a2e","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line012:m0094","start":94,"end":95,"surface":"謙","kind":"person","person_id":"0c6_0ce_a2e","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-com